WEBVTT

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:33.403
Every society is vulnerable
to accepting propaganda as truth,

00:05:33.427 --> 00:05:36.235
and no society where propaganda
replaces the truth

00:05:36.259 --> 00:05:38.021
can be truly free.

00:05:38.349 --> 00:05:39.507
Thank you.

00:05:39.531 --> 00:05:43.547
(Applause)